  "description": "Trail adventures without limits. Untamed. Wild. And packed with maximum power. Our ALLTRAIL 10 is equipped with the very best, offering you trail riding at the highest level. For the new season, we’ve completely overhauled our high-performance full-suspension eBike – from a new, more agile frame platform to the latest Bosch Performance CX motor. With the strong 800Wh battery and the optional Range Extender, your riding range is bigger than ever. The Sram drivetrain, powerful Shimano four-piston disc brakes and premium RockShox suspension, with 140mm of travel front and rear, ensure you’re ready for even the most demanding trails. Available with 29″ or 27.5″ wheels (size S). Yes, this bike is the perfect companion for untamed and wild bike adventures.",
